== cafe | AFTERNOON · CO-WORKING CAFÉ | busy café with freelancers working on laptops and big windows | cafe +laptop
musa (worried): Quddus, I sent forty proposals on a freelance site. Zero replies. My profile says I can do everything.
quddus (think): That's the problem. When you do everything, nobody knows what you're good at.
musa (shrug): But I CAN do everything. Design, writing, video, and I fix phones.
quddus (talk): Pick one niche first. For example: logos for small restaurants. Clients search for specific help.
> 1f3af | START SMART | 1f3af Pick one clear niche | 1f4bc Show 3 to 5 sample projects | 1f4dd Short, personal proposals

== office | NEXT WEEK · HOME STUDIO | small home studio with a design tablet, a laptop and plants | desk @musa
musa (type): And my proposals?
quddus (point): Short and personal. Mention their exact problem, how you'd solve it, and one sample that matches. No copy-paste essays.
musa (think): And if I have no reviews?
quddus (thumbs): Start with smaller jobs, deliver fast, and ask happy clients for a review. Reviews grow from there.
musa (cheer): Niche chosen: logos for food businesses. My first client just replied!
